{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a3ce0eb35f9176382260d30d0f25dc139f193a7e6e65d0e12dc07a11030bd42e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比伦的下场"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["此后，我看见另一位执掌大权的天使从天而降，他的荣光照亮了大地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他用强有力的声音喊道：",{"text":"“巴比伦大城倒塌了！倒塌了！","poem":1},{"noteId":23},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她成了鬼魔的住处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各样污秽之灵的巢穴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各样污秽之鸟的老巢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各样污秽可憎之兽的老窝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为列国都喝了她淫乱的烈酒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的君王与她通奸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的商人也因她穷奢极侈的生活而发了财。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我听见天上又有一个声音说：",{"text":"“我的子民啊，离开那城，","poem":1},{"noteId":24},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以免沾染她的罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受她所受的灾祸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她已经罪恶滔天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝没有忘记她的不义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她怎样待人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要怎样待她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要按她所做的加倍地报应她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用她调酒的杯加倍地调给她喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她过去怎样自炫自耀、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奢华荒淫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在也要让她怎样痛苦哀伤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她心里说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我贵为女王，不是寡妇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"绝不会经历哀伤。’","poem":1},{"noteId":25}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以在一天之内，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的灾祸，就是死亡、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀伤和饥荒要同时临到她身上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她要被火烧尽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为审判她的主上帝大有能力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["“地上曾与她通奸、一同奢华享乐的君王目睹焚烧她的烟，必为她哭泣哀号。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们对她所受的灾祸充满恐惧，就远远地站着说，",{"text":"“‘雄伟坚固的巴比伦城啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有祸了！有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为审判顷刻间临到你了。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["“地上的商人也为她痛哭哀伤，因为再也没有人购买他们的货物了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们的金、银、宝石、珍珠、细麻布、紫布、丝绸、朱红色布、各种香木、象牙器具，贵重木材、铜、铁、大理石制品，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["以及肉桂、豆蔻、香料、香膏、乳香、酒、油、细面粉、小麦、牛、羊、马、车、仆婢和人口都没有人购买了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他们呼喊，‘你贪爱的美物已离你而去了，一切珍馐美味和奢华之物都消失殆尽，无影无踪。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["“靠贩卖这些货物给她而致富的商人对她所受的灾祸充满恐惧，就站在远处为她哀伤哭号，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["说，‘身穿紫色和朱红色细麻布衣服，并用黄金、宝石、珍珠为装饰的大城啊，有祸了！有祸了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["因为顷刻间你这一切的繁华都化为乌有了。’所有船主、船客、水手及靠海为生的人都远远地站着，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["看见烧她的烟，就高喊，‘有哪一座城能与这座大城相比呢？’"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["他们又把尘土撒在头上，哀伤哭泣，高喊，",{"text":"“‘这大城啊，有祸了！有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有经营航运的都因她的奢华而发了财，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是顷刻间她却沦为废墟了！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上天啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众圣徒、众使徒和众先知啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为她的下场欢喜吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为上帝已经对她下了判决，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为你们申冤了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["这时，有一位大能天使举起一块像大磨石的石头扔进海里，说：",{"text":"“巴比伦大城也必这样被用力扔下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"消失得无影无踪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你那里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也听不见弹琴作乐、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弄笛吹号的声音了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也找不到能工巧匠了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也听不到推磨的声音了，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也看不到闪耀的灯光了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也听不见新郎新娘的声音了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你的商人在世上显赫一时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国都被你的邪术迷惑，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的城内流了众先知、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众圣徒和地上一切被杀之人的血。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书21:9。","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":2}},{"noteId":24,"caller":"+","text":"耶利米书51:45。","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":4}},{"noteId":25,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书47:7、8。","reference":{"chapter":18,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}